.TH JUST3WS-YOUTUBE 1 2026-10-30 "just3ws" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
just3ws-youtube \- prepare local episode materials and locate the publishing service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./bin/pipeline media youtube
.br
.B ruby bin/youtube_pipeline.rb schedule
.br
.B ruby bin/generate_rewatch_thumbnail.rb
[B\-\-episodeR INR] [B\-\-allR] [B\-\-helpR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The just3ws.github.io repository contains interview archive data, episode scripts, recording materials, and site pages. It does not upload videos, captions, or metadata, change playlists, or manage YouTube quota.
.PP
YouTube publishing is handled by the separate media-pipeline repository. Its Bbin/mpR command and operations cockpit are the supported publishing tools.
.SH UTILITIES
.TP
.B bin/youtube_pipeline.rb schedule
Prints the Season One working target. It does not set release dates.
.TP
.B bin/generate_sound_above_teleprompter.rb
Generates a local teleprompter from an episode dossier.
.TP
.B bin/stage_episode_workflow.rb
Checks local episode materials, transcript availability, OBS cue shape, and teleprompter files.
.TP
.B bin/generate_rewatch_thumbnail.rb
Generates local thumbnail artwork from episode metadata.
.TP
.B Retired publisher entrypoints
Legacy YouTube API writers in this repository exit without making changes and direct operators to media-pipeline.
